nga was during  the war arc and this happened when dabby  faced off  against tokyomi and hawks dabi actually  had the upper hand in this battle  because he was up against two people who  have weakness to either flames or light  but even then with the advantage he  still wasn't able to secure the win  because he kept stalling so that his  body could recover between attacks  then later on when he goes to attack  tokyo army we can literally see his skin  peeling off like it's gross and yeah  it's not not great for derby  therefore out of all sugaraki's close  allies dabi is clearly the one member  who desperately needs an additional  ability  well actually maybe spinner as well  because i mean this guy just sucks  over the years we know that dr garaki  has made several copies  of the super regeneration quirk i'm  pretty sure it would be safe to say that  i mean if we're including the black  nomus the super regeneration quirk is by  far  the quark that has had the most  different uses a power like this would  finally enable dabby to use his  cremation quirk  without any restraints as his body  should immediately heal from the damage  as a result he could begin to try out  new techniques that would normally be  too dangerous for him  such as the prominence burn or hell's  curtain i see no reason why shigaraki  wouldn't do this  as by powering up dabi in this way he  could generally go toe-to-toe with  endeavor  and i think this has to happen because  if these two you know dabi and endeavor  if they're ever gonna fight  without regeneration darby is just gonna  get flamed not just by his own fire but  also by his dads as well  also on a separate note we know that  when all for one found the regeneration  quirk many years ago  it failed to heal his pre-existing  injuries which is why he looks like this  we've also seen in the recent chapters  that shiguraki's missing fingers have  yet to grow back despite him acquiring  super regeneration  so this shows us that the quirk only  works for injuries going forward  but it doesn't heal the injuries you've  already suffered this would mean that  the power would not be enough to heal  dabi's scars if he acquired it  but there's still another quirk out  there that could do that and i'll  explain how shiguraki's fascination with  the quote destroying bullets  has been evident ever since he hijacked  a police vehicle to steal some  and then subsequently asked twice to  replicate them and then asked dr garaki  to replicate them  and then had a bunch of them mass  produced and pocketed about five more of  them after some of them were destroyed  furthermore during the overhaul arc  together found out  that eerie was the source of the bullets  and told shigeraki this over the phone  in fact she even went as far to say that  they didn't manage to kidnap her this  time  which indicates this is something that  shiguraki would obviously be open to  doing  now listen i don't want erie to go  through any more emotional trauma i  don't want it to be kidnapped or any of  this stuff  but when the king of the underworld  wants more quirk replicating bullets  and he is very much aware of the girl  whose blood is able to create them  let's just say there's a few different  ways that could go if at any point  during the series shiguraki encounters  erie  stealing her quirk or copying it that  would be quite a desirable outcome for  him for a lot of reasons not just for  the bullets but obviously he could have  a ton of other applications including  rewinding derby  i know what you're thinking though if we  rewind abby then surely that will just  turn him back into a 12 year old child  or something like that  and while that is a valid point to make  we saw during the overhaul arc itself  that with enough experimentation he was  able to turn a quirk that rewinds  people's ages  into a quirk that rewinds people's  quirks out of existence that's why when  muriel lost his quirk  instead of rewinding him to the age of 3  years old which is probably the last  time he didn't have a quirk  instead it just totally erased his quirk  whilst keeping him  the same age that right there is the  evidence that with enough  experimentation  rewind can be applied in ways that don't  de-age people  but still significantly alter them in  some way if dr graki or shigaraki are  given sufficient time  believe me i'm pretty sure they could  find a way to revert dabi into his  handsome squidward form  although saying that i'm not sure how  much of a priority is to give darby a  makeover  but yeah i'm just throwing the idea out  there now going back to the super  regeneration quirk for a second  an interesting question to ask is  whether or not shigaraki would be  willing to give dabi  his own super generation quirk and the  answer is probably  no because it's a super useful quirk for  anyone to have so shigaraki is likely  going to keep on to his version of it  that said though because shigaraki has  an army of black nomu  at his beckon call like they will  literally only act on his command  and so it's clear that he could simply  order one of them to his location  and do a quick quirk transfer to derby  we saw afo do something similar like  this in the manga  only in that case it was a quirk swap  but you know by passing the regeneration  quirk  immediately to derby from a nomu that's  there's not really any downsides to  doing that because you still have a  whole army with super  generation so at the end of the day all  you would do is take the quark from one  nomu  and give it to one of your you know  leading commanders and that my friends  is the likely way  that i think dabi will gain super  generation and i think it might happen  sooner than we think  as of the last chapter debbie was on his  way to see shigaraki with  obviously the rest of the league of  villains and once they arrived there  shiggy will be  very happy to see them and might do them  a quick favor and give him a few quirks  who knows  anyway people those are my thoughts on  how darby could gain a regeneration  quirk  and therefore defeat endeavour when they  eventually come face to face  let me know in the comments if you'd  like to see him without the scars or if  you just prefer him you know the way he  is the iconic  design of him will the scars uh should  it be taken away or should it be kept  let me know down below  also remember to submit any questions  for the patreon q a  as i will be recording that later this  week and putting it out on the weekend  so yeah be sure to get your questions in  if you have any  peace out

